{"id":861136,"title":"07｜怎样借助DeepSeek R1编写与调试代码？","content":"本文介绍了如何利用DeepSeek R1提高代码编写效率，重点在于解决代码调试这一开发周期中的主要痛点。首先，通过R1生成Python代码，如贪吃蛇游戏，可以显著减少调试时间。R1不仅能够生成代码，还能进行测试和提供扩展建议。对于初学者，使用网页版R1较为直观；而对于有经验的开发者，集成开发环境（IDE）如VSCode或Trae则更高效。在Trae中，R1被直接集成，支持智能代码生成、运行与调试等功能。整个过程包括：先由R1生成代码，然后运行并发现错误，再交由R1修正，直至程序正常运行。此方法打破了传统线性开发流程，强调了调试的重要性。最后，鼓励读者实践，通过IDE和R1修复提供的错误代码，以进一步掌握大模型辅助编程技巧。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398875,"user_name":"术子米德","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1898023,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"382EA7E2AF0B56","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/f6/27/c27599ae.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742465996,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"课程展示的例子，从头到尾都没有“符合预期”，然后居然作为讲解的例子，有种莫名的“尬”。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1272354,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/6a/22/527904b2.jpg","nickname":"zhangwq","note":"","ucode":"DFDFDDDBA4503C","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658806,"discussion_content":"感觉是Trae的广子","content_length":10,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1742700170,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"江苏","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398802,"user_name":"聪少 Jeff","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1159983,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"C791ACA9B47679","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/b3/2f/d08a1363.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742296184,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"请问老师课后作业在哪里？","like_count":1},{"had_liked":f